table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>Abbreviations: BSA, body surface area; ECOG PS, Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group performance status.</p></fn><fn id="t2-fn2"><label/><p>Units: age (years), BSA (m<sup>2</sup>), leucocytes ( &#x000d7; 10<sup>9</sup>&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>), neutrophils ( &#x000d7; 10<sup>9</sup>&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>), treatment duration (days).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Cox model for the association between survival and chemotherapy-induced neutropenia<sup>a</sup></p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Neutropenia</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Hazard ratio (95&#x00025; CI)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Grade 0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.00 (referent)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Grade 1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.74 (0.56&#x02013;0.98)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.0330</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Grade 2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.55 (0.44&#x02013;0.68)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.0001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Grade 3&#x02013;4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.62 (0.44&#x02013;0.85)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.0037</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label>a</label><p>Neutropenia is treated as a time-dependent variable.</p>